---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProductSubNav from '../../components/ProductSubNav.astro';

const SUBNAV = [
  { label: 'All Eligible Products', href: '/preorder' },
  { label: 'Founder Benefits', href: '/preorder/founder-benefits' },
  { label: 'Preorder Terms', href: '/preorder/terms' },
  { label: 'Order Status', href: '/preorder/status' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Preorder Terms | ByteLite LLC"
  description="Terms governing ByteLite LLC founder reservations and any future preorder purchase."
  keywords="ByteLite LLC preorder terms"
>
  <Header slot="header" />
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Preorder', href: '/preorder' }, { label: 'Preorder Terms' }]} /></div></section>
  <ProductSubNav items={SUBNAV} />

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Preorder Terms</h1><p class="legal-sub">Last updated: July 2026</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2><span class="ptl-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7l8-4z"/></svg></span>What a "founder reservation" is.</h2>
        <p>Where no product has an announced launch price, ByteLite LLC offers a no-charge founder reservation instead of a paid preorder. Submitting a reservation does not charge any payment method and does not create a binding purchase obligation. It records your interest and locks in the founder benefit formula described on <a href="/preorder/founder-benefits">Founder Benefits</a> for that product.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2><span class="ptl-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 5L5 19M8 6a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM20 18a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg></span>The founder benefit formula.</h2>
        <p>Where a paid preorder is offered for a priced product, the founder price equals 90% of the standard public launch price, and the entitlement (service duration or usage units) equals the standard entitlement plus ceiling(standard entitlement / 10). This is calculated the same way everywhere on this site and is never described as a flat "20% off."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2><span class="ptl-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></span>Activation.</h2>
        <p>For a paid preorder, any subscription or service entitlement begins at the production-ready release of the purchased service, not at the moment payment is collected, unless a product's specific terms state another explicit trigger.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Refunds and cancellation.</h2>
        <p>A founder reservation can be withdrawn at any time with no cost, since no payment is collected. Refund and cancellation terms for any future paid preorder will be disclosed on that product's preorder page before checkout, per the standard payment processor's terms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>No stored payment data.</h2>
        <p>ByteLite LLC does not build or operate a custom card-storage system. Any future paid preorder or reservation payment would be processed by a third-party payment processor; ByteLite LLC would not receive or store full card data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Relationship to the restaurant pilot.</h2>
        <p>The HeartStrings Restaurant Partner Program's $20 pilot placement is a live, already-available paid product and is not part of the founder preorder/reservation system described here. See the <a href="/products/heartstrings-connect/date-planning/restaurants/partner-program">Restaurant Partner Program</a> page for its own terms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Changes.</h2>
        <p>These terms may be updated as products approach launch. The version disclosed to you at the time of any future purchase governs that purchase.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Contact.</h2>
        <p>Questions about a reservation may be directed through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-hero { padding: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem; }
.legal-sub { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: .9375rem; color: #555e7a; }
.legal-body { max-width: 760px; }
.legal-section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
.legal-section h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #e4e7f2; margin-bottom: .875rem; padding-bottom: .625rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2235; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .625rem; }
.ptl-icon { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 1.875rem; height: 1.875rem; border-radius: .5rem; background: rgba(129,140,248,.12); color: #818cf8; flex-shrink: 0; }
.legal-section p { font-size: .9375rem; color: #7b829e; line-height: 1.75; }
.legal-section a { color: #818cf8; }
</style>
